        "text": "According to Petitioner (United States), the case concerns whether speech that proposes an unlawful transaction, even if false, is protected by the First Amendment."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Petitioner (United States)",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "f22ed9248edc2d65f02d3b1e2f12bd07722b72fda05629ff99e65bb729cd7233",
