            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 3,
              "start": 3
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Petitioner (United States), the United States argues that such speech is not protected by the First Amendment."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "General Clement",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "f22ed9248edc2d65f02d3b1e2f12bd07722b72fda05629ff99e65bb729cd7233",
            "evidence_ids": [
